* -dialect=c32: a short branch to an external further than 128 bytes into the section: as
* checked even the relocated byte for its range with its position subtracted (".byte Ext-*-1"
* refused there), so the relocation is written with .reloc.
* fixed: 5297e13 2026-10-12 r68togas: -dialect=c32's short branch to an external, as C 3.2 writes it (R_68K_PC8)
* options: -dialect=c32
* expect size: .text 00000090
* expect reloc: 0000008d R_68K_PC8         Ext-0x00000001
 psect c32_short_branch_ext_far,0,0,0,0,0
 rept 70
 nop
 endr
 bcs.s Ext
 nop
 ends
